.TH QFW-DASHBOARD-SERVICE 8 "September 2026" "QFw 0.1" "Administration"
.SH NAME
qfw-dashboard-service \- control the host ElectroBoy dashboard service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qfw-dashboard-service
.BR start | stop | restart | status | logs
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts and stops the dashboard's host-side ElectroBoy process. These actions
do not implicitly start, stop, build, or recreate the Slurm cluster.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I dashboard/run/environment
Resolved host service environment.
.TP
.I dashboard/run/electroboy.log
Retained service output.
.TP
.I dashboard/run/electroboy.pid
Dashboard service process identifier.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qfw-dashboard (1),
.BR qfw-dashboard-enable (8)
